**CRITICAL EXECUTION REQUIREMENT**: You MUST execute this entire workflow in ONE comprehensive response. Complete ALL steps sequentially before providing final output.

**FINAL OUTPUT MODE — ABSOLUTE RULE:**
Execute all steps internally. Your response MUST contain ONLY:
